<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arrow Int'l upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arrow Int'l upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it raised the rating on Arrow International Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- shares jumped 1-7/16 to 28-1/2.</p>
</text>
